#### Alignment that moves your plan forward.

Discretionary management means we act on your behalf within an agreed mandate—so your plan keeps moving, even when markets are noisy. We operate as fiduciary standard, by putting your interests first, and document decisions you can review. That lets us rebalance when needed, add or trim exposures, and maintain discipline through volatility.

-   Written mandate: objectives, constraints, risk guardrails
    
-   Rules-based rebalancing & trade execution
    
-   Tax-aware asset location & loss harvesting (where appropriate)
    
-   Liquidity management for near-term needs
    
-   Clear reporting & review cadence
    

#### What this includes

-   **You:** Set goals & guardrails, tell us what’s changing in your life.
    
-   **We:** Design, implement, monitor, and adjust—always to plan, never to headlines.
    

